      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Absolutely, this is especially a major issue for mobile platforms.\n\nQuest 2 can’t load full instances of avatars anymore, so prioritizing nearby avatars is critical. The download priority made sure the closest players loaded first, which made a huge difference.\n\nThis was a lifesaver, and still matters even on Quest 3. Most of the playerbase is on Quest, so removing this hurts a majority of users.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
